{"meta":{"format_version":"4.5","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"armour_dreadnought_harness","model_identifier":"armour_dreadnought_harness","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## armour_dreadnought_harness\n\nArmour, the Dreadnought's own harness: the tier 8 harness in his look (Patch 7). His armour copied off `heavy_knight` (Jade's model, unchanged) cube for cube with its own pixels, as it looks today, as a worn piece fit to `heavy_knight_body`.\n\n- Cubes: 32. Texture 256x128, embedded, heavy_knight's own pixels repacked to the faces used (1 texel per unit on the plates, 2 on the scale mail, as the source). Alpha is used only for the scalloped coin-scale hems (skirt hem, outer pauldron tier and lame): render with alpha test / cutout, as heavy_knight.\n- Bounds at rest: x -25.5..25.5, y 22.0..65.5, z -9.0..9.0 (51.0 x 43.5 x 18.0 units = 143 x 122 x 51 cm).\n- Pieces, each in the body bone it moves with (same names and rest origins as heavy_knight_body):\n  - `torso` (0, 42, 0): the steel cuirass: breastplate, chest plate, keel, the stepped v-neck (7 cubes), backplate, fauld, the two collar plates over the shoulders and the two leather side straps (16 cubes).\n  - `pauldron_r` / `pauldron_l` (+-18, 60, 0): the tan coin-scale pauldrons, 3 stepped tiers each (6 cubes).\n  - `pauldron_lame_r` / `pauldron_lame_l` (+-18, 59, 0) under `arm_upper_r` / `arm_upper_l`: the scalloped lame down the outside of each upper arm (2 cubes).\n  - `skirt_fr`, `skirt_br` (7, 36, 0) and `skirt_fl`, `skirt_bl` (-7, 36, 0) under `hips`: the four quarters of the coin-scale skirt, top and lower row each (8 cubes).\n- The pauldron, lame and skirt bones are heavy_knight_body's baked secondary-motion bones, so the harness moves exactly as his armour does today in all nine clips. No clips of its own.\n- heavy_knight has no vambraces, gauntlets, greaves or sabatons: his arms and legs are bare, his wrists are in leather bracers and he wears leather boots. Those stay on heavy_knight_body; the harness is all the armour he has.\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"skirt_fr_top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0,29,-8.5],"to":[14,36,0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[7,36,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,92,28,106],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[164,92,181,106],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[28,92,56,106],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[181,92,198,106],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[87,58,115,75],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[115,58,143,75],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"5c6b3ceb-0a4a-5da8-b859-8738bad996c0"},{"name":"skirt_fl_top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-14,29,-8.5],"to":[0,36,0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-7,36,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[28,92,0,106],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[198,92,181,106],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[56,92,28,106],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[181,92,164,106],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[115,58,87,75],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[143,58,115,75],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0924a209-b217-5ea2-8d0e-82c54157a135"},{"name":"skirt_fr_low","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0,22,-9],"to":[14.5,29.5,0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[7,36,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[52,76,81,91],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[168,76,186,91],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[81,76,110,91],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[186,76,204,91],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[224,34,253,52],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,58,29,76],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"28d49785-3c55-54be-938f-e0c9f0ca477f"},{"name":"skirt_fl_low","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-14.5,22,-9],"to":[0,29.5,0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-7,36,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[81,76,52,91],"tex